    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目内容包含：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.关于总统府三个字是谁书写</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.明朝初期，归德侯府、汉王府，以及周边的沐府、郭府</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.清朝两江总督府，并且与江宁织造府一起，组成江南二巨头</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目提到的名字有：</span></p><span></span><p><span>蒋介石、李宗仁</span></p><span></span><p><span>孙中山</span></p><span></span><p><span>周钟岳：“总统府”三个字的书写者</span></p><span></span><p><span>蔡锷、唐继尧、龙云</span></p><span></span><p><span>谭延闿、谭泽闿</span></p><span></span><p><span>戴季陶、姚冶诚、蒋纬国</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈义经</span></p><span></span><p><span>朱元璋</span></p><span></span><p><span>韩林儿、刘福通</span></p><span></span><p><span>张士诚</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈友谅、陈理</span></p><span></span><p><span>明玉珍、明升</span></p><span></span><p><span>朱棣、朱高炽、朱瞻基</span></p><span></span><p><span>朱高煦</span></p><span></span><p><span>沐英</span></p><span></span><p><span>郭兴、郭英</span></p><span></span><p><span>努尔哈赤、多铎、多尔衮、勒克德浑</span></p><span></span><p><span>钱谦益</span></p><span></span><p><span>洪承畴</span></p><span></span><p><span>康熙、鳌拜</span></p><span></span><p><span>马国柱、马鸣佩</span></p><span></span><p><span>朗廷佐</span></p><span></span><p><span>郑成功</span></p><span></span><p><span>大于成龙、张鹏翮</span></p><span></span><p><span>小于成龙</span></p><span></span><p><span>史贻直</span></p><span></span><p><span>尹继善、袁枚</span></p><span></span><p><span>曹玺、曹寅、曹颙、曹頫、曹雪芹</span></p><span></span><p><span>乔纳森·斯宾塞（史景迁）</span></p><span></span><p><span>雍正、乾隆</span></p><span></span><p><span>王翚、杨晋、冷枚、王云</span></p>]]></description>
